              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Column chart of median return on budget by audience-rating band. Return rises monotonically with rating: films rated below 5 return 0.73 times their budget, films rated 6.5 to 7 return 2.10 times, and films rated 7.5 or above return 4.27 times. Only the top two bands sit above the 2.5 times break-even line.'"
